      <h1 class="blog-title">Boiler Making a Noise? Banging, Whistling and Gurgling Explained</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">A boiler makes a soft hum when it runs. Anything louder is a sign that something needs attention. Here is what each noise usually means, and what to do about it.</p>
      <div class="blog-meta">
        <span><strong>By</strong> Liverpool Emergency Plumber</span>
        <span><strong>Gas Safe Registered Plumber</strong></span>
        <span>Published 27 November 2026</span>
        <span>5 min read</span>
      </div>
    </div>
